{"word":"ὅλος","uri":"holos","senses":[{"word":"ὅλος","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ὅλος,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">ὅλη,\nὅλον :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> qui forme un tout, tout\nentier, entier : <span class=\"grec\">στρατὸς ὅλος,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Pd.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">O.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">10, 35,</span> une armée entière ; <span class=\"grec\">τὸ σῶμ’ ὅλον,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Eccl.</span> <span class=\"refch\">63,</span> le\ncorps entier ; <span class=\"grec\">ὅλη πόλις,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ph.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1131,</span> <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> <span class=\"grec\">πόλις ὅλη,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Gorg.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">512</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span>, une ville entière,\ntoute une ville ; <span class=\"grec\">ὅλη ἡ πόλις</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">ou</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἡ πόλις ὅλη,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Rsp.</span>\n<span class=\"refpa\">519</span><span class=\"refpb\">e</span>, la\nville entière ; <span class=\"ital\">avec idée de temps :</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">τῆς ἡμέρας ὅλης,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">An.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 3, 11,</span> tout le jour ; <span class=\"grec\">δι’ ὅλης\nτῆς νυκτός,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">An.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 2, 4 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">τὴν νύχθ’ ὅλην,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Conv.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">219</span><span class=\"refpb\">c</span>, toute la nuit ;\n<span class=\"ital\">avec un n. abstrait :</span> <span class=\"grec\">τὴν ὅλην ἀδικίαν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Rsp.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">344</span><span class=\"refpb\">c